   ],
   "skos:broader": {
    "@id": "wg:theories-of-ageing"
   },
   "skos:definition": "Laura Carstensen's lifespan theory that people's goals depend on how much time they feel they have left: when the future seems open, they favour exploration and new information; when it feels limited, they prioritise emotionally meaningful relationships and experiences.",
